    <briefdescription>
<para>Custom traits to do nothing on deletion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Specialize <ref refid="structllvm_1_1ilist__alloc__traits" kindref="compound">ilist_alloc_traits</ref> to inherit from this to disable the non-intrusive deletion in iplist (which implies ownership).</para>
<para>If you want purely intrusive semantics with no callbacks, consider using <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1simple__ilist" kindref="compound">simple_ilist</ref></emphasis> instead.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">template</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">struct<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">ilist_alloc_traits&lt;MyType&gt;<sp/>:<sp/>ilist_noalloc_traits&lt;MyType&gt;<sp/>{};</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
